{
  "native_artifact_sha256": "55b415a21bd1a935979b01cd8ab21a823e8a9fea09a919463236598dfae8ced4",
  "sdk_segments": [
    {
      "text": "Not—",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 510,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 0,
      "token_end_index": 2
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, they will be.",
      "start_ms": 510,
      "end_ms": 990,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 2,
      "token_end_index": 8
    },
    {
      "text": " You know, Linux literature.",
      "start_ms": 1110,
      "end_ms": 2070,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 8,
      "token_end_index": 16
    },
    {
      "text": " It'll have to be, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 2250,
      "end_ms": 2970,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 16,
      "token_end_index": 25
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. I think that might be good as well.",
      "start_ms": 3150,
      "end_ms": 4830,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 25,
      "token_end_index": 39
    },
    {
      "text": " Mm-hm.",
      "start_ms": 5130,
      "end_ms": 5490,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 39,
      "token_end_index": 43
    },
    {
      "text": " Instead of wider range of people.",
      "start_ms": 5670,
      "end_ms": 7470,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 43,
      "token_end_index": 54
    },
    {
      "text": " So how many people are we going to try and—",
      "start_ms": 7530,
      "end_ms": 9450,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 54,
      "token_end_index": 67
    },
    {
      "text": " I'm just thinking like 3 or 4, maybe.",
      "start_ms": 9630,
      "end_ms": 11430,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 67,
      "token_end_index": 83
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 11610,
      "end_ms": 11790,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 83,
      "token_end_index": 85
    },
    {
      "text": " That would be a good—",
      "start_ms": 11910,
      "end_ms": 12570,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 85,
      "token_end_index": 92
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 12930,
      "end_ms": 13230,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 92,
      "token_end_index": 95
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 13410,
      "end_ms": 13590,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 95,
      "token_end_index": 97
    },
    {
      "text": " I think—",
      "start_ms": 13770,
      "end_ms": 13950,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 97,
      "token_end_index": 101
    },
    {
      "text": " I was thinking, you know, like 10.",
      "start_ms": 13950,
      "end_ms": 15150,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 101,
      "token_end_index": 115
    },
    {
      "text": " No.",
      "start_ms": 15270,
      "end_ms": 15330,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 115,
      "token_end_index": 116
    },
    {
      "text": " No.",
      "start_ms": 15630,
      "end_ms": 15690,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 116,
      "token_end_index": 117
    },
    {
      "text": " It was like, \"Forever,\" and then you've got to analyze the results.",
      "start_ms": 16410,
      "end_ms": 18990,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 117,
      "token_end_index": 140
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, exactly.",
      "start_ms": 19050,
      "end_ms": 19410,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 140,
      "token_end_index": 146
    },
    {
      "text": " No, no, no, no.",
      "start_ms": 19470,
      "end_ms": 19950,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 146,
      "token_end_index": 154
    },
    {
      "text": " Like the thing is, I did an ETI course a while ago, and it's just, that's what they— you know, there's 3 people.",
      "start_ms": 20010,
      "end_ms": 25890,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 154,
      "token_end_index": 193
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 26130,
      "end_ms": 26370,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 193,
      "token_end_index": 196
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. And that was fine. Then you can do a massive amount of analysis on 3 people.",
      "start_ms": 26490,
      "end_ms": 30630,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 196,
      "token_end_index": 223
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 31230,
      "end_ms": 31530,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 223,
      "token_end_index": 226
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. Yeah. Oh, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 31650,
      "end_ms": 33510,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 226,
      "token_end_index": 234
    },
    {
      "text": " How can you get a range of people if you have 3?",
      "start_ms": 34890,
      "end_ms": 37110,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 234,
      "token_end_index": 250
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. One computer scientist.",
      "start_ms": 37230,
      "end_ms": 38910,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 250,
      "token_end_index": 257
    },
    {
      "text": " One art student.",
      "start_ms": 39690,
      "end_ms": 40590,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 257,
      "token_end_index": 261
    },
    {
      "text": " And one dude off the street.",
      "start_ms": 40950,
      "end_ms": 42090,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 261,
      "token_end_index": 269
    },
    {
      "text": " And then one's supposed to be a woman, one's supposed to be a man, and one—",
      "start_ms": 44010,
      "end_ms": 46830,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 269,
      "token_end_index": 295
    },
    {
      "text": " Invisible man.",
      "start_ms": 47610,
      "end_ms": 48570,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 295,
      "token_end_index": 300
    },
    {
      "text": " I know. Maybe we should just have 2.",
      "start_ms": 49290,
      "end_ms": 51870,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 300,
      "token_end_index": 313
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, one man, one woman. Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 52890,
      "end_ms": 54270,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 313,
      "token_end_index": 324
    },
    {
      "text": " You're a poor—",
      "start_ms": 54450,
      "end_ms": 55110,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 324,
      "token_end_index": 331
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh, dear.",
      "start_ms": 55770,
      "end_ms": 56250,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 331,
      "token_end_index": 335
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh God. But yeah, if he finds them, then that's cool. If he finds the people.",
      "start_ms": 56550,
      "end_ms": 60870,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 335,
      "token_end_index": 360
    },
    {
      "text": " Another thing.",
      "start_ms": 63270,
      "end_ms": 63750,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 360,
      "token_end_index": 364
    },
    {
      "text": " Just—",
      "start_ms": 63870,
      "end_ms": 64290,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 364,
      "token_end_index": 366
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh, right. We have the presentation on, like, in 1 and a half weeks or something. Whatever it is.",
      "start_ms": 65310,
      "end_ms": 71430,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 366,
      "token_end_index": 397
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 71670,
      "end_ms": 71790,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 397,
      "token_end_index": 399
    },
    {
      "text": " Or nearly 2 weeks.",
      "start_ms": 71910,
      "end_ms": 72870,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 399,
      "token_end_index": 406
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, it's Tuesday.",
      "start_ms": 73590,
      "end_ms": 74670,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 406,
      "token_end_index": 414
    },
    {
      "text": " 2 weeks.",
