      "end_ms": 81150,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 447,
      "token_end_index": 449
    },
    {
      "text": " I think so. I thought the evaluation maybe for the report. So the report on the 25th.",
      "start_ms": 81690,
      "end_ms": 88170,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 449,
      "token_end_index": 478
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh, right. Is that the Friday?",
